msgid "Minim/MWOSD OSD Quick Installation Guide"
msgstr "Minim/MWOSD OSD 快速安装指南"

#: ../../source/docs/common-minim-osd-quick-installation-guide.rst:7
#: 2a6cdad785b74885b6aebb9c81f76a61 3693949405004681a764e59dba9f2cb4
#: af759e83791b4c1fa51d4d96b8a98624 b96c7672730a48819eec8ed0763f477c
#: ec53b284474044d58190a2e76aeefc52
msgid ""
"`MinimOSD <https://code.google.com/archive/p/arducam-"
"osd/wikis/minimosd.wiki>`__ \"On-Screen Display\" is a small circuit board "
"that pulls telemetry data from your autopilot and over-lays it on your "
":ref:`First Person View <common-fpv-first-person-view>` monitor.  The Minim "
"OSD was designed and programmed by Sandro Benigno and Jani Hirvinen"
msgstr ""
"`MinimOSD <https://code.google.com/archive/p/arducam-"
"osd/wikis/minimosd.wiki>`__ 「屏幕显示」是一块小型电路板，可从飞控获取数传数据并叠加到您的 :ref:`第一人称视角 "
"<common-fpv-first-person-view>` 监视器上。Minim OSD 由 Sandro Benigno 和 Jani "
"Hirvinen 设计和编程。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-minim-osd-quick-installation-guide.rst:11
#: 152be9eef7524a019ba0ac0488da11d4 43051b7439544966a96d601505d4a860
#: 4a83af5b8e5646e1ac31a556a791fa69 56ef8fdc7e5e4040987916668bd94599
#: 6f3a5d6f198f46adb0609045ed5a9a96
msgid ""
"This article provides brief instructions for how to connect the board. For "
"more detailed instructions please refer to the `MinimOSD Project wiki "
"<https://code.google.com/archive/p/arducam-osd/wikis/minimosd.wiki>`__."
msgstr ""
"本文提供了连接该板的简要说明。更详细的说明请参阅 `MinimOSD 项目 wiki "
"<https://code.google.com/archive/p/arducam-osd/wikis/minimosd.wiki>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-minim-osd-quick-installation-guide.rst:15
#: 1772e9e2d9c4492eaa3e9c1629d4c7fe a0e065ec5b4947cba02bbbb56df9193f
#: c367ddb1ae384f2aa20ab6df0d86e6ac cb5e3d1586e146edb1b88c8d2fe33f72
#: e58e9b74ed164bc588f7eb9c6b8c58ed
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-minim-osd-quick-installation-guide.rst:17
#: 0fabd1ad6c13456c90c1498156c26aa4 3a23626575a4463ebd8d692e5179f005
#: 7f918c8a646a47e6a81a75f2b57c1694 8e71eeb444da412ab9e0361661f905c1
#: e6f12baf177146cda925e82540878083
msgid ""
"Connect the MinimOSD to the any of the autopilot's serial ports as shown "
"below.  Note that the MinimOSD only \"listens\" so it is possible (but not "
"recommended) to connect it in parallel with a telemetry radio (e.g. "
":ref:`SiK Radio <common-sik-telemetry-radio>` or similar)."
msgstr ""
"按照下图将 MinimOSD 连接到飞控的任意串口。请注意，MinimOSD 只「监听」数据，因此可以（但不建议）将其与数传电台（例如 "
":ref:`SiK Radio <common-sik-telemetry-radio>` 或类似设备）并联连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-minim-osd-quick-installation-guide.rst:22
#: 0ea7ede02d644488a39a66c7585b5907 37617c5206184a8392133f3c6a973016
#: 5a3930a8cc5f4b49adf786da4451a53f 83ff8de85c774c848ad9b7af423a70b3
#: ea9d756f7be2438eabd0709eb52aa0af
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIALx_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (MAVLink1) because "
"MinimOSD does not understand MAVLink2"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`SERIALx_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 设置为 `1`（MAVLink1），因为 MinimOSD "
"不支持 MAVLink2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-minim-osd-quick-installation-guide.rst:25
#: 35ea00db371a4bbb8515cd02abb646fb 43b7d5c03e0e42da813ef99a590a00da
#: 4cf30e429dc54c74b3fb08726aa01967 6d563db4f9b04a5790cd214247a44359
#: eb859c0ec1c2403d8afcc65efff0f740
msgid "Basic wiring Diagram"
msgstr "基本接线图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-minim-osd-quick-installation-guide.rst:27
#: 2ffbb2867d76458c92ee7994457b00e5 4260817e85764f69963802271695be9b
#: 42f754397dd345ac8cf8c8fc81c0f888 6ccfd0d9652247488567007ffa7d96a0
#: e4260cd403b04dfeafc8f630f21db266
msgid ""
"The original MinimOSD's power setup provides two stages to avoid noises "
"coming from servos attached to your ArduPilot boards. Those noises could "
"introduce some glitches on video signal. The independent analog powering "
"from a dedicated battery will heat the board considerably, but the video is "
"the most clean as possible from MAX7456."
msgstr ""
"原始 MinimOSD 的供电设计分为两级，以避免来自连接到 ArduPilot "
"板上舵机的噪声干扰。这些噪声可能会在视频信号上引入杂波。使用独立电池进行模拟供电会使板子明显发热，但来自 MAX7456 的视频信号将尽可能清晰。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-minim-osd-quick-installation-guide.rst:33
#: 08148e9ce007433eb4f886c4d0d678aa 94e6ee6bfae944deaf513a9bf63230c8
#: 95166cab60f34f81a4d50d42c76ef0fe 9ae977ca8d8049cd839aacc3fdbcecec
#: a15152caaf5f44ba9edf6cf8bbcb55bb
msgid ""
"Maybe you don't need to use the two stages. The way those noises would "
"impact on the video signal will vary depending on a chain of aspects like "
"servo's brand, model, cables length, etc. So, try yourself and see if it's "
"important for your setup."
msgstr ""
"您可能不需要使用两级供电。这些噪声对视频信号的影响程度因舵机品牌、型号、线缆长度等多种因素而异。因此，请自行测试，看看这对您的设置是否重要。"

