msgid ""
"The second stage regulator from the MinimOSD boards earlier than V1.1 gets "
"too hot on 12V video setups. If your frame does not have good air flow for "
"cooling the OSD board you may want to feed the OSD entirely from the "
"autopilot. Probably it will add some noises from servos, but you'll be more "
"safe this way:"
msgstr ""
"早于 V1.1 版本的 MinimOSD 板上的二级稳压器在 12V 视频设置下会过热。如果您的机架没有良好的气流来冷却 OSD "
"板，您可能希望完全由飞控为 OSD 供电。这可能会增加来自舵机的噪声，但这样更安全："

