msgid ""
"The AEROMAX is slightly smaller than traditional minimOSD, has the "
"additional KV mods,further I/O pins, a more efficient power consumption and "
"a hardware IC that is far more resilient to power fluctuations providing a "
"cleaner image."
msgstr ""
"AEROMAX 比传统 minimOSD 略小，加入了额外的 KV 改装（KV mods）、更多 I/O 引脚，功耗更低，并且其硬件 IC "
"对电源波动的耐受性更强，可提供更干净的图像。"
